1
00:00:00,293 --> 00:00:01,293
[SIGHS]

2
00:00:01,461 --> 00:00:04,551
All right, I will give you my bed
on one condition.

3
00:00:04,714 --> 00:00:08,304
(Penny:)That you promise to zip your hole
for the next eight hours.

4
00:00:09,343 --> 00:00:12,513
- May I say one last thing?
- Only if it doesn't rhyme.

5
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,350
All right.

6
00:00:20,396 --> 00:00:22,146
Good night.

7
00:00:25,234 --> 00:00:27,694
Turn-ons, let me see.

8
00:00:27,862 --> 00:00:30,202
(Michaela:)Reading a good book in front of the fire...

9
00:00:30,364 --> 00:00:32,534
(Michaela:)...long walks on the beach...

10
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,870
...and getting freaky on the Sabbath
with a bacon cheeseburger.

11
00:00:40,291 --> 00:00:43,041
Really? Me too.

12
00:00:44,754 --> 00:00:47,344
(Michaela:)Oy gevalt, you're hot.

13
00:00:48,633 --> 00:00:50,343
(Penny:)Yeah.

14
00:00:50,802 --> 00:00:52,802
(Howard:)Excuse me for a moment.

15
00:00:56,682 --> 00:01:01,022
- Hey. How's it going?
- Cut the crap. You set this up, didn't you?

